Retry a song's key when Spotify answers with its "try again" refusal (librespot pull request #1763).

librespot asks Spotify for each song's decryption key. Sometimes Spotify refuses with code 0x0002, which
means "try again", and a second try a moment later often works. Without this, librespot gives up on the
first refusal and skips the song. With it, librespot asks up to 3 times, a second apart, and only gives
up after that. Taken from https://github.com/librespot-org/librespot/pull/1763 (not merged yet), so it
can sit on top of the newest librespot. librespot.sh applies this file.

